Package: mailix
Version: 0.2.5
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: stikkx <stikkx@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libx11-6, libxcursor1, libxrandr2, libxi6, libxinerama1, libxext6, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libwayland-client0
Recommends: xdg-utils
Suggests: gnome-keyring | keepassxc
Section: mail
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/stikkx/mailix
Description: Fast, lightweight, IMAP-first desktop mail client
 Native desktop mail client (iced, no webview): IMAP-first with a local
 SQLite cache, tantivy full-text search, conversations, drafts, attachments
 and an optional AI assistant. Passwords stay in the OS keyring.